onsuming the existing item expires/cleans the timed-out putter.\n            assert q.get_nowait() == \"first\"\n            q.task_done()\n            assert len(q._putters) == 0\n            assert q.empty()\n        finally:\n            for _item, putter in list(q._putters):\n                if not putter.done():\n                    putter.cancel()\n            q._putters.clear()\n            while not q.empty():\n                q.get_nowait()\n                q.task_done()\n\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```",
